## Summary
A new Mexico expansion mod for Red Dead Redemption 2 called Nuevo Paraiso is set to release in September. Modders have been creating Mexico re-creations since the game's launch, but this latest attempt is described as the most detailed yet.

## Key Points
- Nuevo Paraiso is the latest Mexico-themed expansion mod for Red Dead Redemption 2
- The mod is scheduled for release in September
- Modders have been attempting Mexico map expansions since the game's original release
- Previous attempts have existed, but Nuevo Paraiso is noted as the most detailed yet
- The inspiration comes from Red Dead 1's inclusion of New Austin and West Elizabeth without extending south of the border


